      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain 88 (28 squares x 3 ch + 4). Row 1: tr in 8th ch from hook (1 open square), then follow row 1 of the chart. Turn." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Charted rows" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "For each open square: ch 2, skip 2, tr in next tr. For each filled square: tr in each of next 3 tr. Follow the rose chart for 28 rows. The rose occupies a central 20 x 20 square area with an open border of 4 squares on each side." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Fasten off and weave in the end. Work a dc edging around all four sides. Block to the square shape." }]
